        ('90030009-0000-4000-8000-000000000014', 'Assertion (A): Democracy is regarded as the most preferred form of government across the modern world.
Reason (R): Democratic governments are more accountable to the people and allow room for correcting mistakes through consultation.', '{"A":"Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A","B":"Both A and R are true but R is NOT correct explanation of A","C":"A is true but R is false","D":"A is false but R is true"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'ASSERTION_REASON', 'Social Science', 'What is Democracy? Why Democracy?', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Democracy improves decision-making quality through debate, accommodates diverse social groups, and provides constitutional mechanisms to peacefully correct errors.', 'MEDIUM', true),
        ('90030009-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'What were the three estates in 18th-century French society? Which estate paid all the taxes?', NULL, NULL, 'VSA', 'Social Science', 'The French Revolution', 2, 'The three estates were: First Estate (Clergy), Second Estate (Nobility), and Third Estate (Big businessmen, merchants, court officials, lawyers, peasants, and landless artisans). Only the Third Estate paid all direct and indirect taxes (Taille and Tithe).', '1 Mark for listing the 3 estates correctly; 1 Mark for specifying that the Third Estate bore all taxes', NULL, NULL, 'MEDIUM', true),
        ('90030009-0000-4000-8000-000000000016', 'What is the ''Preamble'' to the Indian Constitution? State any two core democratic values enshrined in it.', NULL, NULL, 'VSA', 'Social Science', 'Constitutional Design', 2, 'The Preamble is an introductory guiding statement that sets out the guiding purposes, principles, and philosophy of the Constitution. Core values: Sovereign, Socialist, Secular, Democratic, Republic, Justice, Liberty, Equality, and Fraternity (any two).', '1 Mark for definition of Preamble; 1 Mark for mentioning two core values with brief context', NULL, NULL, 'MEDIUM', true),
