        ('90030015-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'On 14th July 1789, the agitated people of Paris stormed which fortress prison, symbolizing royal despotism?', '{"A":"Bastille","B":"Tuileries","C":"Versailles","D":"Louvre"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'MCQ', 'Social Science', 'The French Revolution', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The storming of the Bastille on July 14, 1789, marked the dramatic outbreak of the French Revolution against Louis XVI''s autocratic rule.', 'MEDIUM', true),
