        ('9003002d-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'The infamous ''Enabling Act'' passed on 3rd March 1933 in Germany allowed Hitler to:', '{"A":"Declare war on Britain","B":"Establish dictatorship and rule by decree without parliament","C":"Abolish the Nazi party","D":"Form the Weimar Republic"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'MCQ', 'Social Science', 'Nazism and the Rise of Hitler', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Enabling Act suspended civil liberties, bypassed the Reichstag, and established Hitler''s dictatorial totalitarian rule.', 'MEDIUM', true),
